 e.g., to @('\"v1.12.3\"') or @('\"v1.13\"').</p>

 @({
 cd ccl
 curl -O -L https://github.com/Clozure/ccl/releases/download/v1.12.2/darwinx86.tar.gz
 tar xfz darwinx86.tar.gz
 })

