;                    (:instance baz-of-three)))))

; We fixed a small bug in extended-ancestors, to guarantee that argument to
; canonical-ancestors is canonical.  We have not attempted to analyze how
; serious this bug may be.

; Here is a proof of nil following the example from Sol Swords related to the
; "resizable array of stobjs" bug documented in the string below.

