 to be a variable that abbreviates a term.</p>

 <p>Also see @(see acl2-pc::add-abbreviation) for a discussion of abbreviations
 in general, and see @(see acl2-pc::show-abbreviations).</p>")

(defxdoc acl2-pc::repeat
